OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost staying dry with only the
OL,6,Fodd light shower appearing. Rather
OL,7,Fcloudy through the day, but some brief
OL,8,Fbrighter spells are expected, chiefly
OL,9,Ffor Orkney. Winds light and variable.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome limited clear spells but
OL,12,Fotherwise a cloudy evening and night.
OL,13,FMost dry, but the odd light shower may
OL,14,Fcrop up over Shetland. Southwest winds
OL,15,Fmoderate across Shetland.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FSimilar to Tuesday with
OL,18,Fmost staying dry, but probably a
OL,19,Flittle more of brightness breaking
OL,20,Fthrough. Winds light and variable in
OL,21,Fdirection.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
