OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FThe
OL,6,Fpattern remains unchanged with largely
OL,7,Fdry and occasionally bright fare,
OL,8,Fcoupled with light winds.
